    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1069-a1">

                <pb facs="1161" n="1065" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1065"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Galloway to Mr. Hay.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Chamber of Commerce and Manufactures</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Glasgow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1898-02-21"><hi rendition="#italic">February
                                21, 1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The Glasgow Chamber of Commerce, of which I
                    have the honor to be president, representing the commercial interests of Glasgow
                    and the west of Scotland, have read with deep emotion the accounts of the sad
                    catastrophe which befell the United States battle ship <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Maine</hi>, at Habana, on the 15th current, and which has resulted in the
                    loss of so many brave officers and gallant seamen. Permit me, in the name and on
                    behalf of the whole members of the chamber, to assure you of their deep sympathy
                    with the President and people of the United States in this appalling
                    calamity.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">J. Galloway</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >President.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Col. <hi rendition="#small-caps">John Hay</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >The United States Ambassador in England.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
